graph TD
    A([🎓 Start: Visit Admissions Portal]) --> B[Create Account / Log In]
    B --> C[Fill Out Application Form]
    C --> D{All Required
Fields Complete?}
    D -- No --> C
    D -- Yes --> E[Upload Supporting Documents
e.g. Transcripts, ID, Photo]
    E --> F[(OCR Engine Triggered:
Extract & Validate Document Data)]
    F --> G{OCR Validation
Passed?}
    G -- No: Unreadable / Missing --> H[Display Error & Prompt Re-upload]
    H --> E
    G -- Yes --> I[(ERP DB: Save Application
& Generate Reference Number)]
    I --> J[Send Confirmation Email
with Reference Number]
    J --> K[Candidate Visits Application Tracker]
    K --> L[(Query ERP: Fetch
Application Status)]
    L --> M{Application
Status?}
    M -- Under Review --> N[Display: 'Under Review' Message]
    M -- Additional Docs Needed --> O[Notify Candidate to Upload More Docs]
    O --> E
    M -- Decision Made --> P{Admission
Decision}
    P -- Accepted --> Q[Display Acceptance Notice
& Next Steps Link]
    P -- Rejected --> R[Display Rejection Notice
& Feedback if Available]
    Q --> S([✅ End: Candidate Proceeds
to Enrollment])
    R --> T([❌ End: Application Closed])